{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24579","headline":"和梦得洛中早春见赠七韵 · 白居易","name":"和梦得洛中早春见赠七韵","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"衆皆赏春色，君独怜春意。\n春意竟如何，老夫知此味。\n烛余减夜漏，衾暖添朝睡。\n恬和台上风，虚润池边地。\n开迟花养艳，语懒莺含思。\n似讶隔年斋，如劝迎春醉。\n何日同宴游，心期二月二。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_24579.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24579","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}